 `Memory artifact`
 : Small durable note that improves future agent attention. It is not a transcript or a dumping ground.
+
+## Assembly and qualification
+
+**Project Seed**:
+A declared starting composition of layers and capabilities for a generated project.
+
+**Layer Capability**:
+A declared contribution a project layer provides to an assembled project.
+
+**Boundary Report**:
+The findings of checking a proposed artifact or dependency against declared layer ownership and allowed dependency direction.
+
+**Proof Qualification**:
+The finding that live proof met the declared work or capability criteria for the stated scope.
+_Avoid_: Operational Settlement, action authority, capability in the CognitiveOS sense
